---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Workers — Conclave AX" description="Workers are installable AI and tool capabilities managed by Conclave Host.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Workers</div>
    <h1>Choose capability, not a permanent machine identity.</h1>
    <p class="section-intro">Workers are installable integrations that a Host can supervise. The same Worker can serve different Projects and Accounts while each assignment keeps its own context.</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card"><h3>AI and coding</h3><p>Connect the AI and coding capabilities your work needs through the Worker catalog.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Automatic updates</h3><p>Conclave Host resolves, verifies, installs, health-checks, and rolls back Worker versions.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Account-aware execution</h3><p>Accounts keep external AI identity separate from shared Worker software.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
